MODIFICATIONS
This directory contains a LOCALLY MODIFIED copy of GSA 1.03.1, not the
unmodified CRAN release. R/GSA.R adds an `ncores` argument to GSA() to allow
the permutation step to run in parallel; the upstream function has no such
argument. No other functional changes were made.

